// Windows IP Helper API bindings via iphlpapi.dll (rolling).
//
// Goal:
// - Centralize the platform DLL attachment for Windows network configuration queries.
// - Used by `std:net/dns` to locate the default IPv4 resolver without shelling out.
//
// Notes:
// - `GetNetworkParams` returns DWORD (u32): NO_ERROR (0) or Win32 error code.
// - Use `@ffi.ret("u32")` so the native backend zero-extends into Oren’s i64 value model.

@cfg(os="windows")
@ffi.dll("iphlpapi.dll")
ffi { @ffi.ret("u32") GetNetworkParams }

